# Operator 2026-06-17 — Phase 3 native sidecars.
# Source for the OPC UA C# sidecar IS committed (backend/sidecars/opcua-cs/)
# so the VPS / CI can rebuild it. The compiled .NET binaries + the staged
# 76 MB exe are NOT committed — they're regenerated by `dotnet publish`.
# The Mosquitto binaries (~6 MB total) ARE committed so deploys use them
# without a separate download step.
backend/sidecars/opcua-cs/bin/
backend/sidecars/opcua-cs/obj/
backend/sidecars/opcua/

# Old release backup folder — local only.
desktop/last working version/

# Standalone fork (operator 2026-06-18). Has its OWN .git/ inside; the
# outer repo ignores it entirely so commits in either repo never leak
# into the other. Push the inner repo to its own GitHub remote.
0.0.0.1000/

# Operator 2026-06-18 — License signing private key.
# The PUBLIC key (license_signing_public.pem) IS committed and bundled
# into the tray EXE so it can verify license signatures offline.
# The PRIVATE key NEVER leaves the dev portal VPS — it lives in
# TRUSTNODE_LICENSE_SIGNING_PRIVATE_PEM env var. If it's accidentally
# generated locally during dev, it must NOT be committed.
backend/keys/license_signing_private.pem
backend/keys/*.private.pem

